      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-heading text-lg mb-3">Atelier & Contact</p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Confection artisanale sur commande.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Montpellier, Occitanie, France</p>
      <a href="mailto:myokan@hotmail.fr" class="block mt-2 font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:underline">
        myokan@hotmail.fr
